{"title":"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3ad57710b6810476e6017ea2c2cc6d41219c218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> is a straight angle.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/f/69fa44da5e7514320da259ca9ddeb38414bdcd97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 80 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 65 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 75 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 70 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3ad57710b6810476e6017ea2c2cc6d41219c218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Straight_angle\" title=\"Straight angle\">straight angle</a>, we know that the sum of the three angles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/8/c487e0700b86d142b368487b1a3af76b0be23444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40^{\\circ} + x^{\\circ} + x^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"167\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Combining like terms on the left side of the equation, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/e/04e5f2c3913fe995d5f54ba6f6ec17dc35a8e303.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40^{\\circ} + 2x^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/3/bc37a1f655537de0702b4d2a6f62de97db08fe6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> from both sides we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1cde639448a5a410fb8bc4ac0556b42a9eb7aaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^{\\circ} = 140^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>This gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/f/40f950dd0f1b091e594cb652a33ae33c617b6fbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 70}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"102\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Pr